---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';

const faqs = [
  { q: 'What size patio works for a typical Lufkin home?', a: 'Most Lufkin homeowners do well with a patio between 200–400 sq ft — large enough for a seating area and grill without overwhelming the yard. We can design to your space and lifestyle, from a compact backyard slab to a sprawling stamped concrete entertaining area.' },
  { q: 'Do I need a permit for a patio in Angelina County?', a: 'Open, ground-level concrete patios typically don\'t require a permit in Angelina County. Covered patios or those attached to the home may require one. We assess each project and handle any required permits as part of the job.' },
  { q: 'What\'s the cost of a concrete patio in Lufkin, TX?', a: 'A standard broom-finish concrete patio in Lufkin runs approximately $8–$12 per sq ft installed. Stamped or decorative concrete runs $15–$25+ per sq ft depending on pattern complexity. We provide a free, itemized estimate for your specific project.' },
  { q: 'Stamped vs regular concrete — which is better for East Texas heat?', a: 'Both perform well in East Texas when properly installed and sealed. Stamped concrete adds visual appeal but requires periodic resealing to maintain appearance in the UV and heat. We use quality sealers rated for southern climates and recommend a maintenance schedule.' },
];

const schema = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'Service',
    name: 'Patio Construction in Lufkin TX',
    provider: { '@type': 'GeneralContractor', '@id': 'https://www.purposeconstructionco.com/#business', name: 'Purpose Construction', url: 'https://www.purposeconstructionco.com/' },
    areaServed: { '@type': 'City', name: 'Lufkin', containedInPlace: { '@type': 'State', name: 'Texas' } },
    description: 'Patio construction in Lufkin, TX. Concrete patios, stamped concrete, pavers, and covered patio structures for Angelina County homeowners.',
  },
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'FAQPage',
    mainEntity: faqs.map((faq) => ({
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: faq.q,
      acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: faq.a },
    })),
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Patio Construction in Lufkin, TX | Purpose Construction"
  description="Patio construction in Lufkin, TX: concrete, stamped concrete, pavers and covered patios graded to drain. Free estimates: (936) 255-2235."
  schema={schema}
>
  <Breadcrumb items={[
    { label: 'Services', href: '/services/' },
    { label: 'Outdoor Living', href: '/outdoor-living/' },
    { label: 'Patio Construction', href: '/patio-construction/' },
  ]} />

  <PageHero
    title="Patio Construction in Lufkin, TX"
    subtitle="Purpose Construction builds concrete patios, stamped concrete, and covered patio structures for Lufkin and Angelina County homeowners — built to last in East Texas conditions."
    tag="Lufkin, TX"
    image="/images/patio-construction-east-texas.jpg"
  />

  <div class="bg-charcoal-900 border-b border-charcoal-700">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Serving Lufkin & Angelina County — Free on-site estimates, no obligation.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <a href="tel:9362552235" class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-red hover:text-white transition-colors duration-150">(936) 255-2235</a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary py-2.5 text-xs">Get a Free Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section-padding bg-warm-50">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
        <div>
          <SectionHeading tag="Lufkin, TX" title="Patio Construction for Lufkin Homes" />
          <div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-charcoal-600">
            <p>A well-built patio is one of the best investments a Lufkin homeowner can make — East Texas weather gives you months of outdoor living time, and a quality concrete or paver patio holds up to the heat, humidity, and UV exposure of the region. Purpose Construction handles patio construction from simple broom-finish slabs to decorative stamped concrete entertainment areas.</p>
            <p>We handle the full scope: grading and drainage planning, base prep, forming, concrete pour, and finishing. Patios are often the first step in a larger <a href="/outdoor-living/" class="text-brand-red hover:underline font-semibold">outdoor living</a> project, and we can plan for a <a href="/pergola-construction/" class="text-brand-red hover:underline font-semibold">pergola or cover structure</a> at the same time to avoid future disruption.</p>
            <p>We use proper sub-base depths and fiber reinforcement specified for East Texas soil conditions to prevent the cracking and settling that shortcuts cause.</p>
            <p>East Texas gets generous rainfall — Lufkin averages around 50 inches per year — which means a patio without proper drainage becomes a pond after every storm. Purpose Construction grades and drains every patio we build so water moves away from your foundation and your outdoor space stays usable after it rains. It's a detail that separates a well-built patio from one that causes problems down the road.</p>
            <p>We pour standard and stamped concrete patios, install paver systems in brick and natural stone patterns, and lay flagstone for a more organic, natural look. Covered patio slabs are engineered to handle the structure above them — we coordinate with the cover installation so footings and slab thickness match what's being built on top.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 flex gap-4">
            <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate</a>
            <a href="tel:9362552235" class="btn-outline">Call (936) 255-2235</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-5">
          <img
            src="/images/patio-construction-east-texas.jpg"
            alt="Patio construction in Lufkin, TX by Purpose Construction"
            class="rounded-xl shadow-hero w-full"
            width="640" height="480"
            loading="lazy" decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-warm-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-card">
            <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-charcoal-400">Contact Information</p>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-charcoal-900">Purpose Construction</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-charcoal-600">Lufkin, TX · serving East Texas</p>
            <a href="tel:9362552235" class="mt-1 block text-sm font-semibold text-brand-red hover:text-brand-red-dark transition-colors duration-150">(936) 255-2235</a>
            <a href="mailto:info@purposeconstructionco.com" class="mt-0.5 block text-sm text-charcoal-500 hover:text-charcoal-800 transition-colors duration-150">info@purposeconstructionco.com</a>
            <div class="mt-3 border-t border-warm-200 pt-3 text-xs text-charcoal-500">
              <p>Mon–Sat: 8:00 AM – 6:00 PM</p>
              <p>Sunday: Closed</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-white border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeading tag="What We Handle" title="Full-Scope Patio Construction" align="center" />
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {[
          'Concrete Patio Slabs', 'Stamped Concrete', 'Flagstone & Pavers',
          'Covered Patio Structures', 'Screen Enclosures', 'Pergola Add-Ons',
          'Drainage Solutions', 'Outdoor Lighting', 'Seating Walls',
          'Step Construction', 'Grading & Base Prep', 'Permit Management',
        ].map((item) => (
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-warm-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-red" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            {item}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-warm-100 border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeading tag="Our Process" title="How Patio Construction Works in Lufkin" />
      <ol class="space-y-6">
        {[
          { step: '1', title: 'Free On-Site Estimate', body: 'We visit your Lufkin property, assess the yard, grading, and drainage, and discuss size, finish, and layout options.' },
          { step: '2', title: 'Written Proposal', body: 'Itemized pricing, concrete spec, reinforcement type, finish selection, and a project schedule.' },
          { step: '3', title: 'Permit & Planning', body: 'We assess permit requirements and pull any needed permits through the City of Lufkin before any excavation begins.' },
          { step: '4', title: 'Excavation & Base Prep', body: 'Area is graded, excavated, and compacted. Base material and vapor barrier are placed and prepped for forming.' },
          { step: '5', title: 'Concrete Pour & Finishing', body: 'Forms set, reinforcement placed, concrete poured, finished, and stamped or textured as specified. Proper curing time observed.' },
          { step: '6', title: 'Sealing & Final Walkthrough', body: 'Sealer applied per spec, forms removed, and any landscaping edging or steps finished. Final walkthrough with you to ensure satisfaction.' },
        ].map((step) => (
          <li class="flex gap-6 items-start">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-red text-white font-display font-bold text-sm" aria-hidden="true">{step.step}</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="display-sm text-charcoal-900 mb-1">{step.title}</h3>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-charcoal-500">{step.body}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-white border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="container-mid px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeading tag="Common Questions" title="Patio Construction FAQs — Lufkin, TX" align="center" />
      <div class="space-y-4">
        {faqs.map((faq) => (
          <details class="group rounded-xl border border-warm-200 bg-warm-50 shadow-card">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 list-none">
              <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-800 pr-4">{faq.q}</h3>
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-charcoal-400 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-charcoal-600">{faq.a}</div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding-sm bg-warm-50 border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeading tag="Also in Lufkin" title="Related Services in Lufkin, TX" />
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {[
          { label: 'Deck Construction', href: '/deck-construction/' },
          { label: 'Pergola Construction', href: '/pergola-construction/' },
          { label: 'Outdoor Living', href: '/outdoor-living/' },
          { label: 'Exterior Painting', href: '/exterior-painting/' },
          { label: 'All Services', href: '/services/' },
        ].map((link) => (
          <a href={link.href} class="rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700 shadow-card hover:border-brand-red-mid hover:text-charcoal-900 transition-all duration-200">
            {link.label} →
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding-sm bg-white border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeading tag="Also Serving" title="Nearby Communities" />
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/locations/nacogdoches/" class="rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-warm-50 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700 shadow-card hover:border-brand-red-mid hover:text-brand-red transition-all duration-200">Nacogdoches →</a>
        <a href="/locations/diboll/" class="rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-warm-50 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700 shadow-card hover:border-brand-red-mid hover:text-brand-red transition-all duration-200">Diboll →</a>
        <a href="/locations/huntington/" class="rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-warm-50 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700 shadow-card hover:border-brand-red-mid hover:text-brand-red transition-all duration-200">Huntington →</a>
        <a href="/locations/hudson/" class="rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-warm-50 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700 shadow-card hover:border-brand-red-mid hover:text-brand-red transition-all duration-200">Hudson →</a>
        <a href="/locations/zavalla/" class="rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-warm-50 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700 shadow-card hover:border-brand-red-mid hover:text-brand-red transition-all duration-200">Zavalla →</a>
        <a href="/locations/" class="rounded-lg border border-brand-red/30 bg-brand-red-light px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-red hover:bg-brand-red hover:text-white transition-all duration-200">All Service Areas →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-gradient-red">
    <div class="container-mid px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="display-md text-white mb-4">Start Your Patio Project in Lufkin</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-xl text-base text-white/80">Call us or fill out the contact form for a free on-site estimate. We serve Lufkin, Nacogdoches, Diboll, Huntington, and all of Angelina County.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-ghost px-8 py-4">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a href="tel:9362552235" class="text-sm font-semibold text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-150">(936) 255-2235</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
